  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{向|む}かう (face toward X / head toward X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing movement or state. {向|む}かっている = 'is heading toward' or 'is facing.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{向|む}かう (head toward X, face X)\n- ⟦{向|む}かい{合|あ}う→向かい合う：23708_mukaiau⟧ (face each other)\n- {向|む}かって⟦{右|みぎ}→右：02257_migi⟧ (on your right as you face it)\n- ⟦{向|む}かい{側|がわ}→向かい側：26865_mukaigawa⟧ (opposite side)\n- ⟦{未来|みらい}→未来：03748_mirai⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{向|む}かう (face the future)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{向|む}く→向く：02304_muku⟧: to turn, to face (more general)\n- ⟦{向|む}ける→向ける：02306_mukeru⟧: to turn something toward (transitive)\n- ⟦{向|む}かい→向かい：03750_mukai⟧: opposite, facing (noun)",
